<title>DUBAI: British foreign office minister arrives in Saudi.</title>
<headline>British foreign office minister arrives in Saudi.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A British foreign office minister arrived in Saudi Arabia on Saturday night for official talks, the Saudi Press Agency reported.</p>
<p>A British embassy statement said Jeremy Hanley, minister of state for foreign and commonwealth affairs' two-day visit to Riyadh was part of a regional tour that will also include Kuwait and Qatar. He is due to meet senior Saudi officials.</p>
</text>
